flowchart LR
    BPX[BPX quadruped SDK] --> Driver[bpx_driver]
    Cmd[/cmd_vel control/] --> Driver
    Driver --> IMU[/imu/data/]
    Driver --> LegOdom[/odom leg/body odometry/]
    Driver --> State[/bpx status and services/]
    IMU --> EKF[bpx_ekf_bringup robot_localization EKF]
    LegOdom --> EKF
    EKF --> Fused[/odom/filtered + odom->base_link/]
    Lidar[sllidar_ros2 /scan] --> SLAM[slam_toolbox_nav2 or cartographer_nav2]
    Lidar --> RF2O[rf2o_laser_odometry fallback]
    RF2O --> Fallback[/odom fallback/]
    Fused --> SLAM
    Fallback --> SLAM
    SLAM --> Map[map + map->odom]
    Map --> Nav2[Nav2 planner/controller/recoveries]
    Nav2 --> Cmd
